 "content": "<p>« <a href=\"../../../pages/ax-b-and-the-four-subspaces/exam-1-review/index.html\">Previous</a> | <a href=\"../../../pages/least-squares-determinants-and-eigenvalues/index.html\">Next</a> »</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"session-overview\">Session Overview</h3>\n\n<p><table>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<img src=\"../../../static_resources/9453ea0a94bc7c74ec1fd1b5a1735673_Exam_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n</td>\n\n<td>\n</p>\n<p>For this exam, you will need to know the results from elimination and the process of elimination using the simple matrices E — with one nonzero off the diagonal.</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n\n    <h3 id=\"check-yourself\">Check Yourself</h3>\n\n\n    <h4 id=\"exams-and-solutions\">Exams and Solutions</h4>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../../resources/mit18_06scf11_ex1/index.html\">Exams (PDF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../resources/mit18_06scf11_ex1s/index.html\">Solutions (PDF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>« <a href=\"../../../pages/ax-b-and-the-four-subspaces/exam-1-review/index.html\">Previous</a> | <a href=\"../../../pages/least-squares-determinants-and-eigenvalues/index.html\">Next</a> »</p>\n",
